WEBVTT

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:48.410
You... idiot!

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:51.540
"Your wounds have suppurated and your stay at the hospital has been extended"?!

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:54.440
That's what you get for sneaking out of the hospital!

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:56.440
If you have any excuses, go ahead and state them right now.

00:01:57.130 --> 00:01:59.300
Well... you see...

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:01.900
...I wanted to feed the cats...

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:03.060
No excuses!

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:03.760
But... you just...

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:04.780
Ahh...
But... you just...

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:04.860
You just don't realize it, do you?
Ahh...

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:07.120
You just don't realize it, do you?

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:10.060
You don't realize the responsibility of being a member of S.S.III.

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:13.830
I will not come to visit you anymore no matter what!
Do I make myself clear?

00:02:14.470 --> 00:02:15.710
Like hell I'm coming!

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:31.180
Seems I made her angry...

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:33.160
Repent, for that's all you can do.

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:36.050
The LT was <i>very</i>  worried about you.

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:40.600
Corporal...

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:43.790
Let's go find him.

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:46.810
Don't just stand there!

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:47.810
Y-Yes, sir!

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:53.420
She just kept yelling and yelling...

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.220
Boy, that was bothersome.

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:56.770
Eh, Machs?

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:58.880
Bothersome, huh?

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:00.650
Yeah.

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:02.200
I guess.

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:07.360
Ah, you're back, eh?

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:08.730
You delinquent patient.

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:11.480
Good Lord...

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:14.780
I will never assign you to your own room from now on.

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:16.900
Mr. Wantz,

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:19.210
as his neighbor, I'm asking you to keep an eye on him please.

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:22.960
If this guy disappears, please ring this bell.

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:24.380
I'm counting on you, okay?

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:25.680
Ahh.

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:27.060
Rosetta.

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:34.410
Please take care of this guy.

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:35.900
He might be disobedient,

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:38.590
but he's a cute little subordinate of mine.

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:41.150
Oh my, are you his friend?

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:42.890
Great timing!

00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:46.080
Could you get a urine sample from him for me?

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:50.990
It's better if the one doing it is also a guy.

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:55.210
Okay, time to go home, Machs.

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.690
Ah... h-hey!

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:02.300
...They left...

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:08.480
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:11.310
You're very fortunate for having
so many co-workers care for you.

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:13.670
Ah, umm...

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:15.630
Call me Wantz.

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:18.610
I work at a briefcase factory.

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:22.130
I've been in the hospital for a week already,

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:25.240
but none of my co-workers have come to see me.

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:30.030
I should be thankful that I have a job at least, though.

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:33.170
I need to work my butt off once this heals.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:44.050
Umm...

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.760
I'll do it myself...

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:48.210
Really?

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:50.730
Sorry to ask you when your leg is injured already.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:55.440
There are paper cups next to the bathroom's entrance!

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:00.120
Pardon me.

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:01.650
No, excuse me.

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:07.870
How are you doing, Wantz-kun?

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:09.030
Chief!

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:13.380
I was getting worried about your body.

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:15.120
Ah... thanks...

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:16.750
Sorry for the trouble...

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:19.160
Don't be; it's what I should be doing.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:22.270
But, I'm glad you look good.

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:50.990
A unit known as 901-ATT in our army does not exist!

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:57.540
Non-existent, eh?

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:59.160
Very well put.

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:02.290
That's why they were called...

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:04.240
..."Invisible 9"...

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:07.240
Invisible... 9...

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:11.930
Hard at work, huh?

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:14.260
Oreld...

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:16.430
What are you secretly looking up?

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:19.190
It's got nothing to do with you, Oreld.

00:06:22.050 --> 00:06:24.400
Nothing to do with me, eh?

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:27.310
How cold of you.

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:32.850
This is about the big guy, right?

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:36.790
Anyone can tell after seeing your attitude at the hospital.

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:41.320
I... like Section III...

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:45.230
At first, I thought "what kind of unit is this?",

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:47.160
but gradually, I started to like it.

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:49.470
But now...

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:54.170
But the corporal's existence might threaten Section III's.

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:06.760
That's what I'm researching.

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:12.630
And how far have you gotten?

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:14.150
I can't tell you.

00:07:14.150 --> 00:07:17.240
This is my own personal investigation.

00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:19.140
Hmm...

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:25.520
Pardon the interruption!

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:28.240
Sergeant Major Machs here...

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:30.590
...has been my friend since we were kids,

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:33.260
and quite frankly, he's very talented.

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:35.260
But even for someone like him...

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:35.680
...at the age of seven,

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:37.260
Section III again?
...at the age of seven,

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:40.610
when we went on a piss break and got "attacked" by a worm,

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:43.020
he... he...

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:44.650
What's that got to do with you?!

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:46.740
That's right.

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:49.860
Your past has nothing to do with me.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:51.360
Neither does the big guy's past.

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:55.060
Of course, his past is none of your business, either.

00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:57.650
That's why you should just forget about all this.

00:07:58.030 --> 00:08:02.090
Yet, you're trying to disguise it as "protecting Section III"?

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:05.330
Stop trying to be the protector of justice.

00:08:07.180 --> 00:08:09.190
Don't be saying things like that.

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:12.010
You, me, and the big guy...

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:15.120
We all have Section III's emblem on our uniform.

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:19.590
Don't be saying things like "it's got nothing to do with you".

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:22.490
Tell me, Machs.

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:28.760
In other words, you found nothing.

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:30.380
What can I do?

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:32.110
I'm only three days into this.

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:35.570
But I do know the unit existed.

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:38.860
It seemed like a ridiculous amount of information flew around...

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:41.860
...between the front lines and the head sector of the army...

00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:43.240
"It seemed like"?

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:44.780
Is this a tip from the boss?

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:47.820
Where's the boss right now?

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:50.880
He went out to report on
the armored tank incident from last time.

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:00.450
The units that don't appear in official documents...

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:03.200
Invisible 9, eh?

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:07.010
That Invisible 9-

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:07.920
Oh, what are you doing here, Oreld?
That Invisible 9-

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:09.520
Oh, what are you doing here, Oreld?

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:12.360
Appreciating the flowers in the garden.

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:14.780
Oh, whatever.

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:17.430
Ask me out for a meal again, okay?

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:18.260
You bet.

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:24.870
Who was that?

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:26.780
Mireille-chan from the personnel department.

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:31.380
Hmm, weird...

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:34.340
A person that came from a unit
that isn't in official documents...

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:37.980
There's no way the personnel department would let that pass.

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:42.230
We are talking about a place where the entire nation's military information is gathered here...

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:45.250
Someone pressured the personnel department?

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:48.270
But there's no way we can check that-

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:52.010
Why are you leaning?

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:54.500
Just leave this to me.

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:05.640
I-I can't, Oreld.

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:07.840
People are going to be back soon.

00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:10.240
It'll be a quickie.

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:11.960
B-But...

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.290
I just can't.

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:17.940
All files in the personnel department are classified.

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:20.140
I can't show them to you...

00:10:20.690 --> 00:10:22.260
No one will find out.

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:23.990
B-But...

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:29.880
Sorry.

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:33.950
The files never really mattered to me.

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:37.450
I wanted to tie you up with me...

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:39.320
...by sharing our little secret.

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:42.520
Troubling you with a cheap trick like this...

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.020
I'm the worst, aren't I?

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:48.040
So long, Mireille.

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:49.930
Oreld!

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:54.000
J-Just finish up before everyone gets back, okay?

00:10:55.610 --> 00:10:56.490
Okay.

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:15.030
Oreld is slow...

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:16.590
Geez...

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:20.320
You sure spent a long time...

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:21.960
Can't help it...

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:23.550
You got lipstick on your face.

00:11:24.340 --> 00:11:26.410
But, I got some results.

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:30.080
When the big guy got assigned to our unit,

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:32.220
a certain organization pushed for it...

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:35.000
...The Imperial Science Laboratory...

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:37.060
The Kauplan Institute?!

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:38.170
Yep.

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:41.110
Then if we look up that place,
we'll be able to know the corporal's-

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:45.300
I... actually like that...

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:49.470
...that it's peaceful and such...

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:54.900
What's the matter?

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:57.210
Sorry, Oreld.

00:11:57.950 --> 00:12:00.550
I want to hear the rest of the story from the corporal himself.

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:04.360
Same here.

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:10.490
Let's go check him out at the hospital.

00:12:10.490 --> 00:12:12.060
At a time like this?

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:14.280
What are you going to the hospital for?

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:15.860
Ah, umm...

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:18.520
What do you two think you're doing by leaving your posts?!

00:12:20.070 --> 00:12:24.530
W-Well... we're... worried about the big guy's health and...

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:28.140
...and if he gets his wounds infected,

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:30.660
I heard that maybe it'll worsen overnight...

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:31.470
What...

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:36.130
And so...

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:37.990
We'll be going to the hospital.

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:42.820
I... I said I wouldn't go to visit him.

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:44.190
Sure...

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:46.410
That's why <i>we</i>  are going.

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:47.970
Excuse us, then.

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:08.530
He's gone again, isn't he?!

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:15.220
What? You're here...

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:21.980
Where's Mr. Wantz?

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:24.760
Well... he hasn't been back...

00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:26.840
...since noon...

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:28.240
Since noon?

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:30.830
Patients in this room are just... gosh...

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:35.230
What's this?

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:36.900
Something in the trash can...

00:13:38.430 --> 00:13:39.630
It's a briefcase...

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:48.840
Are you here, big guy?!

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:50.470
He's here...

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:51.910
What's wrong with you?!

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:53.450
Please come tomorrow if you're visiting-

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:53.910
Now's not the time for this!
Please come tomorrow if you're visiting-

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:55.060
Now's not the time for this!

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:56.230
There's someone on the roof!

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:05.440
Someone's going to jump?

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:06.790
Who?!

00:14:17.490 --> 00:14:18.550
Mr. Wantz!

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:25.080
Please!

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:26.790
Think about this again!

00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:29.600
Committing suicide won't help!

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:31.410
Thank you very much,

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:33.760
but it's all over now.

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:37.980
Mr. Wantz!

00:14:39.990 --> 00:14:41.020
Big guy...

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.770
You'll catch a cold.

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:45.810
Let's go back, Mr. Wantz!

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:49.840
That briefcase...

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:01.770
Do you know what that is?

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:05.640
That's my severance package.

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:07.700
Severance package?

00:15:15.150 --> 00:15:16.460
For twenty years...

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:19.600
I've worked for twenty years...

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:23.950
I've worked for twenty years...

00:15:25.280 --> 00:15:27.460
...and for just resting one week...

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:28.620
...I got fired...

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:37.420
...and all I got was one briefcase...

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:47.970
Mr. Wantz...

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:52.360
For twenty years...

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:56.810
I've worked from dawn till dusk...

00:15:58.170 --> 00:16:01.180
How much have I devoted to the company?

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:05.710
I never had any complaints about my monthly salary,

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:08.100
yet... just one week...

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:12.410
Just for resting one week...

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:19.520
"Hard times"?!

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:20.760
Damn you to hell!

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:25.290
Throwing me out with just one briefcase in these "hard times"...

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:28.210
How am I supposed to live from now on?

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:34.050
How am I going to eat...

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:35.880
How am I going to...

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:40.630
I'll do my best...

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:52.000
I... will do my best...

00:16:57.590 --> 00:17:02.480
I'll do my best... to make our country a better place...

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:06.680
I'll work hard in Section III!

00:17:06.680 --> 00:17:08.050
Don't come near me!

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:15.950
Don't come any closer.

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:21.600
He's so far.

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:23.610
I can't save him.

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:26.370
Will I reach him if I run?

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:28.720
Can I even run properly?

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:31.540
My knee is shaking so much from all this...

00:17:33.180 --> 00:17:38.140
Why not just let me be, neighbor?

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:41.810
This has nothing to do with you.

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:46.580
I do have something to do with this.

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:49.970
I was never sure...

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:54.800
When I turn on the lantern, I just kill everything...

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:58.750
Without the lantern, I can't do anything...

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:04.690
For someone like me who knows nothing but to kill people,

00:18:05.630 --> 00:18:07.850
I was never sure if I could do good in Section III...

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:11.590
...if I could blend in with everyone...

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:17.530
But... I got some confidence in myself today...

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:22.150
Mr. Wantz, you said that the sergeant majors here...

00:18:23.390 --> 00:18:25.730
...were my co-workers...

00:18:27.470 --> 00:18:32.880
That's why I can't let you end
your life with a mistake like this!

00:18:35.810 --> 00:18:38.420
That's rather nosy of you...

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:40.980
I'm sorry.

00:18:45.990 --> 00:18:50.870
I can't believe I'm so needed by someone I just met today...

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:52.700
Mr. Wantz...

00:18:53.520 --> 00:19:00.700
Then, I guess there are still
some jobs that might need me, too...

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:03.030
Mr. Wantz!

00:19:12.320 --> 00:19:13.330
Mr. Wantz!

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:21.470
Big guy!

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:29.150
Sergeant Majors!

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:31.030
Don't group us together!

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:35.000
Ow-ow-ow-ow...

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:37.610
Machs, put some more energy in!

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:40.140
The corporal's too heavy!

00:19:46.710 --> 00:19:47.860
We're saved...

00:19:52.360 --> 00:19:52.660
Come on, you two!

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:54.330
Come on!
Come on, you two!

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:54.810
Come on, you two!

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:55.790
Sergeant Majors!

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:57.970
I can't hold on much longer.

00:19:57.970 --> 00:19:59.340
Let's give it all we've got!

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:00.900
Will that work?

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:01.930
How would I know?

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:03.410
Let's go...

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:05.800
3, 2, 1...

00:20:17.470 --> 00:20:18.980
Hey, Corporal...

00:20:19.640 --> 00:20:20.540
Yeah?

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:22.670
Sorry for being suspicious of you.

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:23.940
Huh?

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:26.410
N-Nevermind.

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:28.970
Lovely moon, isn't it?

00:20:29.590 --> 00:20:31.900
Y-Yeah...

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:41.800
Hmph.

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:43.380
Well, well.

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:45.780
He's doing fine...

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:57.490
Captain Hunks.

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:01.230
Looks like you got yourself out of this jam.

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:07.630
Of course, no one's going to believe a foot soldier dispatched a tank to begin with, anyway.

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:10.620
Who the hell are you?

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:12.600
Pleased to meet you.

00:21:13.060 --> 00:21:16.320
I am the chief of the medical development department at the Kauplan Institute,

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:18.350
Muse Kauplan.

00:21:21.490 --> 00:21:23.260
I finally have it!

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:24.720
An LL-size!

00:21:26.960 --> 00:21:28.040
But...

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:30.400
I'm about to leave the hospital...

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:33.680
Oh, trying to run away victoriously?

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:37.020
Modern medicine is not allowed to accept defeat!

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:40.330
But I don't feel it coming now-

00:21:40.330 --> 00:21:42.120
You arrogant little-

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:45.000
W-Wait...

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:46.240
But...

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:47.830
...gotcha!

00:23:31.320 --> 00:23:32.830
Oh no, Mer-kun!

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:35.000
The corporal brought back a baby!

00:23:35.350 --> 00:23:38.480
Okay! I'm going to take care of it with all my heart!

00:23:39.450 --> 00:23:41.310
Next time, "Bountiful Times".

00:23:41.310 --> 00:23:43.530
Come get us if you're not scared!
